<title>USA: Williamson-Travis WC &amp; ID, Texas, won by Rauscher.</title>
<headline>Williamson-Travis WC &amp; ID, Texas, won by Rauscher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc said it won $2.975 million of Williamson-Travis Counties Water Control &amp; Improvement District No. 1B, Texas, general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 6.08 percent.</p>
</text>
